<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Kinross Sept qtr profit falls.</title>
<headline>Kinross Sept qtr profit falls.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter to end-September versus preceding quarter</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Distrib profit		  10.94 vs 21.97</p>
<p>    Capital spending		 5.67 vs  4.10</p>
<p>    Tonnes milled		 403,000 vs 382,000</p>
<p>    Gold output (kg)		2,321 vs   2,279</p>
<p>    Yield (gram/t)		    5.8 vs 6.0</p>
<p>    Cost (rand/kg)		 47,530 vs 43,863</p>
<p>    Revenue (rand/kg)	    55,153 vs 53,988</p>
<p>Full name: Kinross Mines Ltd, owned by Gencor Ltd.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
